{"subject":"math3","year":2021,"count":22,"origin":"source","generator":"tools/work/build_analysis_from_blocks.py（source_blocks 原文照录，零编造）","analysis":[{"id":"math3-2021-1","num":1,"desc":"变限积分求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（C）","【解析】$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x^{2}}\\left(e^{t^{3}}-1\\right)dt}{x^{7}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{2x\\cdot\\left(e^{x^{6}}-1\\right)}{7x^{6}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{2x^{7}}{7x^{6}}=0$，故 $\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x^{2}}\\left(e^{t^{3}}-1\\right)dt$ 是 $x^{7}$ 的高阶无穷小，故选（C）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-2","num":2,"desc":"分段函数的连续性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（D）","【解析】由于 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}f(x)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{e^{x}-1}{x}=1=f(0)$，故在 $x=0$ 处连续.","又 $f'(0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{f(x)-f(0)}{x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\dfrac{e^{x}-1}{x}-1}{x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{e^{x}-1-x}{x^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{2}$，故可导，选（D）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-3","num":3,"desc":"函数零点个数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（A）","【解析】由 $f(x)=ax-b\\ln x(a>0)$，当 $x>0$ 时，$f'(x)=a-\\dfrac{b}{x}$.","当 $b\\leqslant0$ 时，$f'(x)>0$，$f(x)$ 单调递增，与题意矛盾.","当 $b>0$ 时，令 $f'(x)=0$，则 $x=\\dfrac{b}{a}$，","则当 $x\\in\\left(0,\\dfrac{b}{a}\\right)$ 时，$f'(x)<0$，当 $x\\in\\left(\\dfrac{b}{a},+\\infty\\right)$ 时，$f'(x)>0$.","又 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}f(x)=+\\infty$，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}f(x)=+\\infty$，故令 $f\\left(\\dfrac{b}{a}\\right)=b\\left(1-\\ln\\dfrac{b}{a}\\right)<0$，即 $\\dfrac{b}{a}>e$ 时与 $x$ 轴有两个交点，故选（A）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-4","num":4,"desc":"多元复合函数求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（C）","【解析】$f(x+1,e^{x})=x(x+1)^{2}$ 两边对 $x$ 求导：","$f_{1}'(x+1,e^{x})+f_{2}'(x+1,e^{x})\\cdot e^{x}=(x+1)^{2}+2x(x+1)$","将 $x=0$ 带入，得 $f_{1}'(1,1)+f_{2}'(1,1)=1$；①","$f(x,x^{2})=2x^{2}\\ln x$ 两边对 $x$ 求导：","$f_{1}'(x,x^{2})+f_{2}'(x,x^{2})\\cdot2x=4x\\ln x+2x$","将 $x=1$ 带入，得 $f_{1}'(1,1)+2f_{2}'(1,1)=2$ ②","联立①、②，解得 $f_{1}'(1,1)=0$，$f_{2}'(1,1)=1$，故选（C）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-5","num":5,"desc":"二次型","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（B）","【解析】解法一：","$f(x_{1},x_{2},x_{3})=2x_{2}^{2}+2x_{1}x_{2}+2x_{2}x_{3}+2x_{1}x_{3}$","$=2(x_{2}^{2}+x_{1}x_{2}+x_{2}x_{3})+2x_{1}x_{3}$","$=2\\Bigl[x_{2}^{2}+x_{2}(x_{1}+x_{3})+\\dfrac{1}{4}(x_{1}+x_{3})^{2}\\Bigr]-\\dfrac{1}{2}(x_{1}+x_{3})^{2}+2x_{1}x_{3}$","$=2\\Bigl[x_{2}+\\dfrac{1}{2}(x_{1}+x_{3})\\Bigr]^{2}-\\dfrac{1}{2}(x_{1}-x_{3})^{2}$","故二次型 $f(x_{1},x_{2},x_{3})$ 的正负惯性指数为 1，1.","解法二：$f(x_{1},x_{2},x_{3})=2x_{1}x_{2}+2x_{2}^{2}+2x_{2}x_{3}+2x_{1}x_{3}$ 可得二次型矩阵为 $\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&1\\\\ 1&2&1\\\\ 1&1&0\\end{pmatrix}$，","$|\\lambda E-A|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda&-1&-1\\\\ -1&\\lambda-2&-1\\\\ -1&-1&\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda+1&0&-\\lambda-1\\\\ -1&\\lambda-2&-1\\\\ -1&-1&\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda+1&0&0\\\\ -1&\\lambda-2&-2\\\\ -1&-1&\\lambda-1\\end{vmatrix}=(\\lambda+1)(\\lambda^{2}-3\\lambda)$","$=\\lambda(\\lambda+1)(\\lambda-3)$","故二次型特征值为 $0,-1,3$，二次型 $f(x_{1},x_{2},x_{3})$ 的正负惯性指数为 1,1．"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-6","num":6,"desc":"正交矩阵","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（D）","【解析】由 $A=(\\boldsymbol{a}_{1},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2},\\boldsymbol{a}_{3},\\boldsymbol{a}_{4})$ 为 4 阶正交矩阵，$\\boldsymbol{a}_{1},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2},\\boldsymbol{a}_{3},\\boldsymbol{a}_{4}$ 均为单位向量，且两两正交，","故 $r(B)=3$，且 $\\begin{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\\\ \\boldsymbol{a}_{2}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\\\ \\boldsymbol{a}_{3}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\end{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{a}_{4}=0$ 故 $B\\boldsymbol{x}=0$ 的基础解系为 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{4}$，","$B(\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{a}_{3})=\\begin{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\\\ \\boldsymbol{a}_{2}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\\\ \\boldsymbol{a}_{3}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\end{pmatrix}(\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{a}_{3})=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 1\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$","故 $B\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{\\beta}$ 的通解为 $\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}+k\\boldsymbol{a}_{4}$．"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-7","num":7,"desc":"矩阵的三角分解","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（C）","【解析】本题（A），（B）选项中均有单位矩阵 $E$，经矩阵相乘运算验证，$PAQ$ 结果并不是对角矩阵.","（C）选项验算 $PAQ=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\ 2&-1&0\\\\ -3&2&1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-1\\\\ 2&-1&1\\\\ -1&2&-5\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&1\\\\ 0&1&3\\\\ 0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\ 0&1&0\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，故选（C）.","（D）选项经矩阵相乘运算验证，$PAQ$ 结果也不是对角矩阵."]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-8","num":8,"desc":"条件概率","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（D）","【解析】（A）选项正确：由 $P(A|B)=P(A)$ 知，$A$ 与 $B$ 独立，所以 $P(A|\\overline{B})=P(A)$ 成立.","（B）选项正确：由 $P(A|B)>P(A)$ 知，$P(AB)>P(A)P(B)$","$P(\\overline{A}|\\overline{B})=\\dfrac{P(\\overline{A}\\overline{B})}{P(\\overline{B})}=\\dfrac{1-P(A)-P(B)+P(AB)}{1-P(B)}$","$>\\dfrac{1-P(A)-P(B)+P(A)P(B)}{1-P(B)}$","$=\\dfrac{[1-P(A)][1-P(B)]}{1-P(B)}=1-P(A)=P(\\overline{A})$ 成立.","（C）选项正确：$P(A|B)>P(A|\\overline{B})$ 知，$P(AB)>P(A)P(B)$","故 $P(A|B)=\\dfrac{P(AB)}{P(B)}>P(A)$ 成立.","（D）选项错误：$P(A|A\\cup B)=\\dfrac{P[A\\cap(A\\cup B)]}{P(A\\cup B)}=\\dfrac{P(A)}{P(A\\cup B)}$","$P(\\overline{A}|A\\cup B)=\\dfrac{P(\\overline{A}\\cap(A\\cup B))}{P(A\\cup B)}=\\dfrac{P(\\overline{A}B)}{P(A\\cup B)}=\\dfrac{P(B)-P(AB)}{P(A\\cup B)}$","由 $P(A|A\\cup B)>P(\\overline{A}|A\\cup B)$ 知，$P(A)>P(B)-P(AB)$，无法说明 $P(A)>P(B)$.","选（D）．"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-9","num":9,"desc":"估计量的期望与方差","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（B）","【解析】$E(\\hat{\\theta})=E(\\overline{X}-\\overline{Y})=EX-EY=\\mu_{1}-\\mu_{2}$","$D(\\hat{\\theta})=D(\\overline{X}-\\overline{Y})=D(\\overline{X})+D(\\overline{Y})-2\\mathrm{cov}(\\overline{X},\\overline{Y})=\\dfrac{\\sigma_{1}^{2}+\\sigma_{2}^{2}-2\\rho\\sigma_{1}\\sigma_{2}}{n}$. 选（B）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-10","num":10,"desc":"最大似然估计","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（A）","【解析】$L(\\theta)=\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\theta}{2}\\right)^{3}\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\theta}{4}\\right)^{5}$","$\\ln L(\\theta)=3\\ln\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\theta}{2}\\right)+5\\ln\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\theta}{4}\\right)$，","令 $\\dfrac{d\\ln L(\\theta)}{d\\theta}=\\dfrac{-3}{1-\\theta}+\\dfrac{5}{1+\\theta}=0$，得 $\\hat{\\theta}=\\dfrac{1}{4}$. 选（A）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-11","num":11,"desc":"复合函数求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{\\sin e^{-1}}{2e}$","【解析】$y'\\Big|_{x=1}=\\dfrac{e^{-\\sqrt{x}}\\sin e^{-\\sqrt{x}}}{2\\sqrt{x}}\\Big|_{x=1}=\\dfrac{\\sin e^{-1}}{2e}$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-12","num":12,"desc":"含绝对值的定积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】6","【解析】","$\\displaystyle\\int_{\\sqrt{5}}^{5}\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{|x^{2}-9|}}dx=\\int_{\\sqrt{5}}^{3}\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{9-x^{2}}}dx+\\int_{3}^{5}\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^{2}-9}}dx=-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\int_{\\sqrt{5}}^{3}\\dfrac{d\\left(9-x^{2}\\right)}{\\sqrt{9-x^{2}}}+\\dfrac{1}{2}\\int_{3}^{5}\\dfrac{d\\left(x^{2}-9\\right)}{\\sqrt{x^{2}-9}}$","$=-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\cdot2\\sqrt{9-x^{2}}\\Big|_{\\sqrt{5}}^{3}+\\dfrac{1}{2}\\cdot2\\sqrt{x^{2}-9}\\Big|_{3}^{5}=6.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-13","num":13,"desc":"旋转体体积","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}$","【解析】$V=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}\\pi y^{2}(x)dx=\\int_{0}^{1}\\pi x\\cdot\\sin^{2}\\pi xdx\\xlongequal{x=t/\\pi}\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}\\int_{0}^{\\pi}t\\sin^{2}tdt$","$=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}\\cdot\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\sin^{2}tdt=\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-14","num":14,"desc":"一阶线性差分方程","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$y_{t}=C+\\dfrac{t}{2}(t-1)$（C 为任意常数）","【解析】齐次差分方程 $y_{t+1}-y_{t}=0$，即齐次方程的通解为 C（C 为任意常数），","设特解 $y_{t}^{*}=t\\left(A_{0}+A_{1}t\\right)$，代入原方程得 $(t+1)\\left(A_{0}+A_{1}(t+1)\\right)-t\\left(A_{0}+A_{1}t\\right)=t$，","$A_{0}+2A_{1}t+A_{1}=t$，解得 $A_{0}=-\\dfrac{1}{2},A_{1}=\\dfrac{1}{2}$，故通解为 $y_{t}=C+\\dfrac{t}{2}(t-1)$（C 为任意常数）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-15","num":15,"desc":"行列式的定义","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】-5","【解析】解法一：按照第一行进行行列式展开，","$f(x)=x\\begin{vmatrix}x&2&-1\\\\ 1&x&1\\\\ -1&1&x\\end{vmatrix}-x\\begin{vmatrix}1&2&-1\\\\ 2&x&1\\\\ 2&1&x\\end{vmatrix}+2\\begin{vmatrix}1&x&-1\\\\ 2&1&1\\\\ 2&-1&x\\end{vmatrix}-2x\\begin{vmatrix}1&x&2\\\\ 2&1&x\\\\ 2&-1&1\\end{vmatrix}$","$x\\begin{vmatrix}x&2&-1\\\\ 1&x&1\\\\ -1&1&x\\end{vmatrix}$ 中没有 $x^{3}$ 项，$-x\\begin{vmatrix}1&2&-1\\\\ 2&x&1\\\\ 2&1&x\\end{vmatrix}$ 中 $x^{3}$ 项的系数为 $-1$，$\\begin{vmatrix}1&x&-1\\\\ 2&1&1\\\\ 2&-1&x\\end{vmatrix}$ 中没有 $x^{3}$ 项，","$-2x\\begin{vmatrix}1&x&2\\\\ 2&1&x\\\\ 2&-1&1\\end{vmatrix}$ 中 $x^{3}$ 项的系数为 $-4$，故 $f(x)$ 中 $x^{3}$ 项的系数为 $-5$.","解法二：根据行列式定义，行列式为不同行不同列对应元素乘积的代数和，","$f(x)=\\begin{vmatrix}x&x&1&2x\\\\ 1&x&2&-1\\\\ 2&1&x&1\\\\ 2&-1&1&x\\end{vmatrix}$ 的含 $x^{3}$ 项分别为 $-a_{12}a_{21}a_{33}a_{44}$ 和 $-a_{14}a_{22}a_{33}a_{41}$，即 $-x^{3}$ 和 $-4x^{3}$，","故 $f(x)$ 中 $x^{3}$ 项的系数为 -5."]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-16","num":16,"desc":"条件概率","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{1}{5}$","$X$ 的取值为 0 和 1，分布律为","$\\begin{array}{|c|cc|}\\hline X&0&1\\\\\\hline P&0.5&0.5\\\\\\hline\\end{array}$","$EX=0.5,DX=0.25$","$P\\{Y=0\\}=P\\{X=0\\}\\cdot P\\{Y=0|X=0\\}+P\\{X=1\\}\\cdot P\\{Y=0|X=1\\}=\\dfrac{1}{2}$","同理 $P\\{Y=1\\}=\\dfrac{1}{2}$.","故 $Y$ 的取值为 0 和 1，分布律为","$\\begin{array}{|c|cc|}\\hline Y&0&1\\\\\\hline P&0.5&0.5\\\\\\hline\\end{array}$","$P\\{XY=1\\}=P\\{X=1,Y=1\\}=P\\{X=1\\}\\cdot P\\{Y=1|X=1\\}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\times\\dfrac{3}{5}=\\dfrac{3}{10}$","故","$\\begin{array}{|c|cc|}\\hline XY&0&1\\\\\\hline P&0.7&0.3\\\\\\hline\\end{array}$","$\\rho_{XY}=\\dfrac{EXY-EXEY}{\\sqrt{DX}\\sqrt{DY}}=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{3}{10}-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\times\\dfrac{1}{2}}{\\dfrac{1}{2}\\times\\dfrac{1}{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{5}$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-17","num":17,"desc":"单侧极限","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}\\bigl[a\\arctan\\dfrac{1}{x}+(1+x)^{\\frac{1}{x}}\\bigr]=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}a+\\mathrm{e}$；","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{-}}\\bigl[a\\arctan\\dfrac{1}{x}+(1-x)^{\\frac{1}{x}}\\bigr]=-\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}a+\\mathrm{e}^{-1}$；","则其左极限等于右极限：$\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}a+\\mathrm{e}=-\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}a+\\mathrm{e}^{-1}$，解得 $a=\\dfrac{\\mathrm{e}^{-1}-\\mathrm{e}}{\\pi}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-18","num":18,"desc":"二元函数极值","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】令 $\\begin{cases}f_{x}'(x,y)=\\dfrac{2x^{2}+x-1-y^{2}}{x^{3}}=0,\\\\ f_{y}'(x,y)=\\dfrac{y}{x^{2}}=0,\\end{cases}$ 得驻点 $(-1,0)$ 和 $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2},0\\right)$.","$\\begin{cases}f_{xx}''(x,y)=\\dfrac{-2x^{2}-2x+3+3y^{2}}{x^{4}},\\\\ f_{yx}''(x,y)=-\\dfrac{2y}{x^{3}},\\\\ f_{yy}''(x,y)=\\dfrac{1}{x^{2}},\\end{cases}$","在 $(-1,0)$ 处，$A=3>0,B=0,C=1>0,AC-B^{2}>0$，所以有极小值 $f(-1,0)=2$；","在 $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2},0\\right)$ 处，$A=24>0,B=0,C=4>0,AC-B^{2}>0$,所以有极小值 $f\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2},0\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{2}-2\\ln2$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-19","num":19,"desc":"二重积分极坐标","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D}e^{(x+y)^{2}}(x^{2}-y^{2})\\mathrm{d}x\\mathrm{d}y=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{1}e^{r^{2}+2r^{2}\\cos\\theta\\sin\\theta}(r^{2}\\cos^{2}\\theta-r^{2}\\sin^{2}\\theta)rdr$","$=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}dr\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}e^{r^{2}(1+\\sin2\\theta)}r^{3}\\cos2\\theta d\\theta$$\\qquad=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{r}{2}e^{r^{2}(1+\\sin2\\theta)}\\Big|_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}dr=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\int_{0}^{1}r(e^{2r^{2}}-e^{r^{2}})dr$","$=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\Bigl(\\dfrac{1}{4}e^{2r^{2}}-\\dfrac{1}{2}e^{r^{2}}\\Bigr)\\Big|_{0}^{1}=\\dfrac{1}{8}(e-1)^{2}$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-20","num":20,"desc":"可分离变量微分方程","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】（I）$xy'-(n+1)y=0$,化简得 $\\dfrac{dy}{y}=(n+1)\\dfrac{dx}{x}$，两边积分，得","$\\ln|y|=(n+1)\\ln|x|+C_{0}$，化简得 $y=Cx^{n+1}$.","因为 $y_{n}(1)=\\dfrac{1}{n(n+1)}$,所以 $C=\\dfrac{1}{n(n+1)}$,所以 $y_{n}(x)=\\dfrac{1}{n(n+1)}x^{n+1}$.","（II）令 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\dfrac{\\dfrac{1}{(n+1)(n+2)}x^{n+2}}{\\dfrac{1}{n(n+1)}x^{n+1}}\\right|<1$，得 $-1<x<1$.","$x=1$ 时，$\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{n(n+1)}$ 收敛；$x=-1$ 时，$\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{(-1)^{n+1}}{n(n+1)}$ 收敛；收敛域为 $[-1,1]$.","$S(x)=\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{x^{n+1}}{n(n+1)}=x\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{x^{n}}{n}-\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}$","$=x\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}\\Bigl(\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{x^{n}}{n}\\Bigr)'dx-\\int_{0}^{x}\\Bigl(\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}\\Bigr)'dx$","$=x\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}\\dfrac{1}{1-x}dx-\\int_{0}^{x}\\dfrac{x}{1-x}dx$","$=(1-x)\\ln(1-x)+x$ $\\qquad x\\in[-1,1)$.","$S(1)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to1^{-}}[(1-x)\\ln(1-x)+x]=1$，","所以 $S(x)=\\begin{cases}x+(1-x)\\ln(1-x),&-1\\leqslant x<1\\\\ 1,&x=1\\end{cases}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-21","num":21,"desc":"特征值与特征向量","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】（I）$|\\lambda E-A|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda-2&-1&0\\\\ -1&\\lambda-2&0\\\\ -1&-a&\\lambda-b\\end{vmatrix}$","$=(\\lambda-b)\\Bigl[(\\lambda-2)^{2}-1\\Bigr]=(\\lambda-b)(\\lambda-3)(\\lambda-1)=0$","当 $b=1$ 时，$\\lambda_{1}=\\lambda_{2}=1,\\lambda_{3}=3$，$A$ 相似于对角矩阵，则 $r(E-A)=1$，$a=1$.","$(E-A)=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&-1&0\\\\ -1&-1&0\\\\ -1&-a&0\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}-1&-1&0\\\\ 0&0&0\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\boldsymbol{a}_{1}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\ 1\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$","$(3E-A)=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1&0\\\\ -1&1&0\\\\ -1&-1&2\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&-2\\\\ 0&1&-1\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 1\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$","令可逆矩阵 $P_{1}=(\\boldsymbol{a}_{1},\\boldsymbol{a}_{2},\\boldsymbol{a}_{3})$，使得 $P_{1}^{-1}AP_{1}=\\Lambda=\\begin{pmatrix}1& &\\\\ &1&\\\\ & &3\\end{pmatrix}$.","（II）当 $b=3$ 时，$\\lambda_{1}=\\lambda_{2}=3,\\lambda_{3}=1$，$A$ 相似于对角矩阵，则 $r(3E-A)=1$，$a=-1$","$(3E-A)=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1&0\\\\ -1&1&0\\\\ -1&-a&0\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1&0\\\\ 0&0&0\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 1\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2}=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$，","$(E-A)=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&-1&0\\\\ -1&-1&0\\\\ -1&1&-2\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1&2\\\\ 0&1&-1\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\ 1\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$，","令可逆矩阵 $P_{2}=(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3})$，使得 $P_{2}^{-1}AP_{2}=\\Lambda=\\begin{pmatrix}3& &\\\\ &3&\\\\ & &1\\end{pmatrix}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2021-22","num":22,"desc":"均匀分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2021数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】易知 $X+Y=2,Y>X>0$，且 $X$ 在 $(0,1)$ 上服从均匀分布;","（I）$X$ 的概率密度 $f_{X}(x)=\\begin{cases}1,&0<x<1\\\\ 0,&\\text{其他}\\end{cases}$.","（II）$Z$ 的分布函数 $F_{Z}(z)=P\\{Z\\leqslant z\\}=P\\left\\{\\dfrac{2-X}{X}\\leqslant z\\right\\}$；","$z<1$ 时，$F_{Z}(z)=0$；$z\\geqslant1$ 时，$F_{Z}(z)=\\displaystyle\\int_{\\frac{2}{z+1}}^{1}1dx=1-\\dfrac{2}{z+1}$；","$Z$ 的概率密度为 $f_{Z}(z)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{2}{(z+1)^{2}},&z\\geqslant1\\\\ 0,&z<1\\end{cases}$.","（III）$E\\Bigl(\\dfrac{X}{Y}\\Bigr)=E\\Bigl(\\dfrac{X}{2-X}\\Bigr)=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{x}{2-x}dx=\\int_{0}^{1}\\Bigl(\\dfrac{2}{2-x}-1\\Bigr)dx$","$=-2\\ln|2-x|\\Big|_{0}^{1}-1=2\\ln2-1$."]}]}]}